## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
pytest tests/ -v

# Run only core graph tests (no LLM needed)
pytest tests/test_core.py -v

# Run with coverage
pip install pytest-cov
pytest tests/ --cov=codegrapher --cov-report=term-missing
```

